Hēmanta follows autumn as Rāma seeks Gōdāvarī bath --- Lakṣmaṇa describes frosty days cold nights dim moon --- Lakṣmaṇa describes misty crops golden rice silent rivers --- Lakṣmaṇa recalls ascetic Bharata sleeping cold and bathing --- Lakṣmaṇa praises Bharata reversing base proverb --- Lakṣmaṇa blames cruel Kaikēyī --- Rāma forbids censuring mother and confesses love for Bharata --- Rāma bathes with Sītā Lakṣmaṇa and worships sun